<li><a href="https://links.jianshu.com/go?to=https%3A%2F%2Fcommonmark.org%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">commonmark</a>
<ul>
<li>对应：最严格 解析模式</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>default
